/* The colours of Blast Buddies: the tone rows (five hex colours from the lightest to the darkest, as Tile:Colourise reads them) by name,
   and the named colours (BuddyTint) as 0xRRGGBB numbers. Generated by tools/gen-blast-art.ps1 from docs/design/blast-buddies-art.md. Do not edit by hand: change the design and run the script again. */
USING Progress.Lang.*.
USING ProGriddle.Core.*.
USING ProGriddle.Engine.*.
USING ProGriddle.Games.BlastBuddies.*.

BLOCK-LEVEL ON ERROR UNDO, THROW.

CLASS ProGriddle.Games.BlastBuddies.BuddiesLook FINAL:

    DEFINE PRIVATE STATIC VARIABLE sColour AS INTEGER NO-UNDO EXTENT 46.

    CONSTRUCTOR STATIC BuddiesLook():
        sColour[1] = ColourMath:FromHex("1C1426").
